  "bodyText": "Home\nVisit Us\nExhibitions\nEvents\nOnline Talks\nOxfordshire’s Military Heritage in 50 Objects\nCollections\nBlog\nResearch\nLearning\nShop\nCart\nMy Account\nAbout\nBecome a Friend\nSupport Us\nRoom Hire\n\n01993 810 210\n\nfrontofhouse@sofo.org.uk\n\n  \nHome\nEvents\nExhibitions\nCollections\nFriends’ Membership\nVisit\nShop\nBasket\nMy Account\nOxfordshire’s Military Heritage in 50 Objects\nResearch\nLearning\nOnline Talks\nBlog\nSupport Us\nRoom Hire\nImage Services\nAbout\nBooks\nGifts\nMeet Me at the Soldiers Museum | 2pm – 4pm | Thursday 25 June 2026\n£0.00\n\n30 available\nMeet Me at the Soldiers Museum | 2pm - 4pm | Thursday 25 June 2026 quantity\nAdd to Cart\n\nMeet Me at the Soldiers Museum is our regular reminiscence drop-in for older adults.\n\nThis special edition of Meet Me at the Soldiers Museum features a film screening of the award-winning 1942 classic, Mrs. Miniver.\n\nDrop in, see the film, and walk back into the '40s with our Lee Miller photography exhibition.\n\nFree entry, refreshments provided.\n\nScreening begins at 2pm.\n\nRegular sessions run from 2pm - 4pm, every Thursday during school term times (No sessions during the Easter and Summer holidays).\n\nThese events have been kindly supported by University of Oxford Gardens, Libraries & Museums.\n\nDate: 25-June-2026\nTime: 14:00\n\nLocation: Soldiers of Oxfordshire Museum (The Briefing Room)\nType: digital\n\nRelated products\nArmed Forces Day Celebration | 11am – 4pm Sat 4 July 2026\n£0.00 Add to cart\nMeet Me at the Soldiers Museum | 2pm – 4pm | Thursday 2 July 2026\n£0.00 Add to cart\nThe Rise & Fall of the British Army 1975 – 2025 | Talk | 2pm, 13 June 2026\n£12.00 Add to cart\nSpy Princess: The Life Noor Inayat Khan with Shrabani Basu (Recorded Live at Ditchley Park)\n£9.00 Add to cart\n\nSoldiers of Oxfordshire Museum\nPark Street.\nWoodstock\nOxfordshire OX20 1SN\n\nPhone and Email:\nGeneral Enquiries & Event Tickets: 01993 810 211\nfrontofhouse@sofo.org.uk\n\nPrivacy Policy\nTerms and conditions",
